+# Adopted attempt recovery implementation plan
+
+> Execute with superpowers:subagent-driven-development; do not create worktrees.
+
+Goal: Add incident evidence and v2 archival recovery for owner-adopted uncommitted attempts invalidated by uncovered predecessor commits, preserving v1 behavior.
+
+Architecture: Keep v1 contracts unchanged. Add strict schema dispatch and v2 lifecycle checks using the existing safe archival operations. Reopen relocated evidence through explicit byte overlays, with real Git checks and committed-only fallback. No runtime or workflow changes.
+
+Tradeoff: Separate schema paths preserve compatibility but require checking both when shared archival safeguards change.
+
+- [x] Add first-parent predecessor lineage in source_bindings.py and lazy exports; behavioral tests in temporary Git repositories cover malformed trailers, ancestry, merges, covered-only ranges and digests.
+- [x] Extend materialization.py and broad_evidence.py validators with byte overlays and committed fallback; preserve existing issue codes and validate earlier generations, duplicate slots and review lineage. Test overlay-only evidence and tampering.
+- [x] Add incident builder/validator and v2 capture/dispatch in attempt_migration.py. Derive lifecycle from attestation, bind all files, validate known-failure evidence and predecessor lineage, publish safely and support exact/crash replay.
+- [x] Validate v2 through source/archive logical views, apply existing byte/mode-preserving operations, preserve review gates and status/ancestry checks, and expose CLI capture-invalidated-adopted.
+- [x] Add behavioral recovery integration tests, collect changed test modules, run narrow selectors then retirement suite with pytest -q -n 16 --dist=worksteal in tmux. Review diff and run CLI help/smoke checks.
+- [x] Write output bundle boolean after verification.
+
+Verification: `TMPDIR=/tmp pytest -q -n 16 --dist=worksteal tests/test_retirement*.py tests/test_workflow_lisp_procedure_identity_retirement.py` passed all 1,164 tests in 55.25 seconds. Changed test modules collected successfully; CLI capture success/error smoke checks, unchanged source/broad CLI sets and cold lazy imports passed. `git diff --check` passed. Final review approved ignored-source coverage and candidate index preservation. The temporary-root override matches the existing static preflight fixture; unrelated full-repository tests were not run.
